Strongbox
---------

Files:   data/art/chest_stone_tiny.png
         src/main/resources/assets/atouchofwickedness/textures/entity/chest/strongbox.png
Author:  Malcolm Riley
Source:  https://github.com/malcolmriley/unused-textures
         blocks/chest_stone_tiny.png, at commit 8b85ad732023174d9a9da74e6bf2272d6c0bef17. The file
         under data/art/ is the unmodified copy. The Strongbox's chest sheet is built from it by
         scripts/build-textures.py, which stretches the tiny chest's four faces onto vanilla's chest
         model, darkens its top for the inside, paints the latch out of its front and gives the lock
         a crimson Seal of its own.
